{"id":"8d6b68ddf2f4afd6","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-proper-poset-characterization.md","title":"Proper Poset Characterization","display":"thm-proper-poset-characterization — Proper Poset Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-proper-poset-characterization","aliases":["58-thm-proper-poset-characterization","Proper Poset Characterization","Properness Conditions"],"display":"thm-proper-poset-characterization — Proper Poset Characterization","depends_on":["[[58-df-proper]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-proper-poset-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-proper-poset-characterization</span><span>Proper Poset Characterization</span><span>Properness Conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-proper-poset-characterization — Proper Poset Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L,M,H,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,\\theta\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L,M,H,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proper}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proper}(P)\\)</span> are the exact predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the poset predicate inherited by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_P\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_P\\)</span> have the meanings fixed in that upstream definition</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\operatorname{Proper}(P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\operatorname{Proper}(P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}master}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land P\\in H\\land\\leq_P\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall p\\in P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\n\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{112pt}\\to\\forall r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_P(d,r))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}master}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land P\\in H\\land\\leq_P\\in H\\\\\n&amp;\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall p\\in P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\n\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{112pt}\\to\\forall r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_P(d,r))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper forcing preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> under countable support iterations.</li>\n<li>PFA quantifies over all proper posets; ccc posets form a familiar subclass of proper posets.</li>\n<li>The order, fixed membership language, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> carrier, and both membership structures are retained throughout.  This avoids applying elementary-substructure notation directly to bare carrier sets and prevents vacuous choices of an unrelated language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)$ and $\\operatorname{Proper}(P)$ are the exact predicates from [[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ is the poset predicate inherited by [[58-df-proper]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L,M,H,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proper}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}characterization} \\vdash \\operatorname{Proper}(P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset\\text{-}master}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land P\\in H\\land\\leq_P\\in H\\\\\n&\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land P\\in M\\land\\leq_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\\\\\n&\\to\\forall p\\in P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\n\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\hspace{112pt}\\to\\forall r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_P(d,r))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":2543,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-proper-poset-characterization.md|58-thm-proper-poset-characterizat